Short:        Official OpenGL benchmark (binary 68030+68881)
Author:       rputney@vnet.ibm.com (Rob Putney) [ported to MesaGL: Niels.Froehling@Informatik.Uni-Oldenburg.DE (Niels Froehling)]
Uploader:     Niels Froehling Informatik Uni-Oldenburg DE (Niels Froehling)
Type:         dev/c
Requires:     ixemul
Architecture: m68k-amigaos

 This is an AmigaOS-port of the official benchmark-program from SGI.
 Included are the binary, the required GL-libs (MesaGL 3.0ß8).
